{"root":{"data":{"id":"djd143jk9pc0","created":1781872582027,"text":"坚持以人民为中心","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djd17q1trhs0","created":1781872866113,"text":"人民性是马克思主义的本质属性和鲜明品格"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djd1r9g5q4w0","created":1781874397257,"text":"人民是历史的创造者，是真正的英雄"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djd1qziiu2w0","created":1781874375632,"text":"打江山、守江山，守的是人民的心","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djd1rmzz9cw0","created":1781874426754,"text":"民心是最大的政治，决定事业兴衰成败。"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}